Lifting constructions: swapped-front equivalences, `splitSuccLiftFamily`,
`prefixSecondSliceLeftFamily`, `secondSliceLiftFamily`, and the
`moveChainLift` construction that lifts an `r`-step chain to `r+1`.
-/

